]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/pakistan-4-troops-6-terrorists-killed-in-90-minute-gun-battle-at-karachi-rangers-hq/articleshow/132044781.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T08:30:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132044812,imgsize-1364551.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['They came to take selfies, not to help': Venezuela quake victims rage as death toll hits 1,430]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132044658.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/they-came-to-take-selfies-not-to-help-venezuela-quake-victims-rage-as-death-toll-hits-1430/articleshow/132044658.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/they-came-to-take-selfies-not-to-help-venezuela-quake-victims-rage-as-death-toll-hits-1430/articleshow/132044658.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T08:19:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132044763,imgsize-126667.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Vigilant, lethal and ready': US conducts strikes on 10 Iranian military targets — video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132044375.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US forces launched strikes on 10 Iranian military targets near the Strait of Hormuz following an Iranian drone attack on a commercial oil tanker. The operation, ordered by President Trump, targeted surveillance, communication, and drone facilities. This escalation occurs despite an interim ceasefire, with Washington warning of further action if hostilities persist.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/vigilant-lethal-and-ready-us-unleashes-fresh-strikes-on-10-iranian-military-targets-video/articleshow/132044375.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/vigilant-lethal-and-ready-us-unleashes-fresh-strikes-on-10-iranian-military-targets-video/articleshow/132044375.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T07:09:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132044469,imgsize-4982398.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Will be forced to militarily complete the job': Trump warns Iran after US strikes over 2nd ceasefire breach]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132044147.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The US launched fresh strikes on Iran after accusing Tehran of violating a ceasefire for a second consecutive day by attacking a commercial oil tanker near the Strait of Hormuz. This follows US retaliation for a drone attack on another vessel. Iran has warned of a "practical response" to the US actions, escalating regional tensions despite ongoing diplomatic efforts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/middle-east-tensions-flare-up-us-strikes-iran-after-second-ceasefire-violation/articleshow/132044147.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/middle-east-tensions-flare-up-us-strikes-iran-after-second-ceasefire-violation/articleshow/132044147.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T04:50:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132044233,imgsize-1002779.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian student who works at Tesla says he faced F1 visa rejections twice: 'I stopped trying to win over, I built my profile']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132042112.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-student-who-works-at-tesla-says-he-faced-f1-visa-rejection-twice-i-stopped-trying-to-win-over-i-built-my-profile/articleshow/132042112.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-student-who-works-at-tesla-says-he-faced-f1-visa-rejection-twice-i-stopped-trying-to-win-over-i-built-my-profile/articleshow/132042112.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T02:16:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132042114,imgsize-71462.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nigerian proverb of the day: "One who has been bitten by a snake lives in fear of worms" and why old wounds make us fear harmless things]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132042076.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Nigerian proverb, "One who has been bitten by a snake lives in fear of worms," highlights how past trauma can lead to unwarranted caution. While learning from painful experiences is vital for survival, the saying warns against letting fear expand to harmless situations. True wisdom lies in distinguishing real threats from imagined ones, preventing a life consumed by unnecessary dread.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/nigerian-proverb-of-the-day-one-who-has-been-bitten-by-a-snake-lives-in-fear-of-worms-and-why-old-wounds-make-us-fear-harmless-things/articleshow/132042076.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/nigerian-proverb-of-the-day-one-who-has-been-bitten-by-a-snake-lives-in-fear-of-worms-and-why-old-wounds-make-us-fear-harmless-things/articleshow/132042076.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132042086,imgsize-156470.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Canadian proverb of the day: "Do not yell 'dinner' until your knife is in the loaf" and a lesson on humility, patience]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132042044.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-proverb-of-the-day-do-not-yell-dinner-until-your-knife-is-in-the-loaf-and-a-lesson-on-humility-patience/articleshow/132042044.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canadian-proverb-of-the-day-do-not-yell-dinner-until-your-knife-is-in-the-loaf-and-a-lesson-on-humility-patience/articleshow/132042044.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-06-28T01:40:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132042050,imgsize-183932.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by US Supreme Court Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg: "Fight for the things that you care about, but…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132041960.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-us-supreme-court-justice-ruth-bader-ginsburg-fight-for-the-things-that-you-care-about-but/articleshow/132041960.cms]]>